flowchart TB
  Client[Enterprise clients] -->|HTTPS and OIDC JWT| Gateway[GKE Gateway API]
  Gateway --> API[Fastify policy gateway]

  subgraph Online[Online serving plane]
    API -->|trusted tenant context| AgentEngine[Vertex AI Agent Engine]
    AgentEngine --> ADK[Google ADK agent]
    ADK --> Gemini[Gemini on Vertex AI]
    ADK --> VertexRAG[Vertex AI RAG]
    ADK --> DBSearch[Databricks AI Search]
    ADK --> DBSQL[Databricks SQL Warehouse]
    DBSearch --> Unity[Unity Catalog and Delta]
    DBSQL --> Unity
    API --> Cache[(Redis response cache)]
    API --> PostgreSQL[(Cloud SQL PostgreSQL)]
  end

  subgraph Ingestion[Queue-driven ingestion plane]
    Uploads[Cloud Storage] --> Producer[Ingestion producer]
    Producer --> Queue[(BullMQ Redis queue)]
    Queue -->|KEDA ScaledJob, no HPA| Workers[Ephemeral ingestion workers]
    Workers --> VertexRAG
    Workers --> PostgreSQL
  end

  subgraph Autonomy[Isolated autonomy plane]
    AX[Google AX control plane] --> Substrate[Agent Substrate]
    Substrate --> Actor[Sandboxed ephemeral actor]
    Actor --> Repo[Read-only Git workspace]
    Actor --> Audit[Evaluation and audit results]
  end

  Secrets[Secret Manager and Workload Identity] -.-> API
  Secrets -.-> AgentEngine
  Observe[Cloud Logging, Trace and Monitoring] -.-> API
  Observe -.-> AgentEngine
  Observe -.-> Workers
  Observe -.-> Actor
  CICD[GitLab CI/CD with WIF] --> Registry[Artifact Registry]
  Registry --> API
  Registry --> Workers
  Registry --> Actor
